_software\"","\"ipo_working_capital\"","\"other_fd_excluded\"","\"related_loans_excluded\"","\"tax_rate\"","\"minimum_cash\"","\"debt_rate\"","\"new_debt_rate\"","\"new_debt_cap\"","\"term_principal_annual\"","\"cc_due_postentry_month\"","\"issue_discount\"","\"issue_fee\"","\"rescue_cash_cap\"","\"rescue_share_cap\"","\"maintenance_fraction\"","\"growth_fixed_fraction\"","\"depreciation_fraction\"","\"planned_ipo_completion_months\"","\"terminal_roic_ceiling\"","\"terminal_growth\"","\"terminal_discount\"","\"cash_cycles\"","\"horizon\"","\"scenarios\"","\"initial_other_onwc_components\"","\"nonoperating_advances_excluded\"","\"diagnostic_exit_ebitda_multiples\"","\"crore INR; full standalone cash path; every forward value is an analyst assumption\"","\"11500000\"","\".0337\"","\".6291\"","\"8.4961\"","\".2979\"","\"-1.0194\"","\"14.3274\"","\"4.7730\"","\"1.6048\"","\".6962\"","\"9.5795\"","\"6.2388\"","\".02\"","\".1986\"","\".03\"","\"1220800\"","\".0153\"","\"18\"","\".035\"","\"ar_days\"","\"inventory_days\"","\"ap_days\"","\"other_onwc_fraction\"","\"terminal_project_cash\"","\"preentry_growth\"","\"-.03\"","\".015\"","\".145\"","\"28\"","\"-.01\"","\".17\"","\"35\"","\"-.015\"","\"timing\"","\"terminal\"","\"no_project_revenue\"","\"discount\"","\"optional_debt_fees\"","\"Parent operating business only. Excludes unproven terminal/Saudi revenue and terminal value, but explicit cash contributions3–6crore stress the parent. No claim this captures full contractual project obligation; funding package ND.\"","\"No FD release or new financing; all ordinary cash payments tested intraperiod from audited31March2026 cash. Failure is an assumptions result, not evidence of actual issuer default.\"","\"Unverified timing assumption: existing earmarked WC FD can be released against operating payables/payroll only; capex FDs only against matching equipment/packing/software. Finite pools. This is NOT a verified committed facility. No transfer from unrelated FDs.\"","\"After a successful pre-entry bridge only, optional equity at entry with whole-share count and authorized/cash ceilings. Optional debt separately capped and paid/charged; never represented as committed.\"","\"Seven actual-day pre-entry intervals total 202 days ending 19 October 2026, then 60 equal monthly intervals plus 12 continuation months. Operating cash out before collections in 8 cycles; debt and capex tested separately.\"","\"No terminal result after any cash breach. One continuation year pays actual operatingcapital, maintenance and economic reinvestment to cap incremental return at 15%; no new finance or earmark release in continuation. Retain maximum required intra-year cash reserve; subtract outstanding debt once; exclude unrecovered loans/earmarked FD.\"","\"Signed operating balance -1.0194 crore: components in initial_other_onwc_components, AR26 notes 6,9,10,14,18,19. Includes operating GST and employee provisions; excludes income-tax/TDS, debt, related-party financing, FD, IPO expenditure and project advances. Security deposits included consistently as tied-up operating capital. Component total is recomputed in verification.\"","\"Mathura project value not included because cost, capacity, returns and funding undisclosed. Scenario contributions are bounded stresses, not claimed total project cost.\"","\"15% nominal INR terminal capital charge is an explicit conservative analyst assumption, separately chosen from the 15% equity hurdle; it is not a measured company WACC.\"","\"Optional debt credits gross proceeds equal to net cash: upfront debt fee assumed zero, unverified and optimistic. Ongoing14% cash interest and full year-five principal are charged; no implicit committed facility or fee funding is invented.\"","\"Diagnostic year-five EV / year-five operating EBITDA multiples 8, 10 and 12. Only already cash-surviving paths qualify; use the identical earned operating reserve, excess cash, debt and diluted shares. No preferred rerating or new financing; intrinsic FCFF remains primary.\"","\"advance_to_suppliers\"","\"prepaid\"","\"employee_advances\"","\"security_deposit\"","\"gst_input\"","\"salary_payable\"","\"other_vendor_payable\"","\"employee_PT_PF_ESIC_LWF\"","\"expense_provision\"","\"gratuity_long_short\"","\"gst_payable\"","\".5209\"","\".1565\"","\".1113\"","\".2008\"","\".5449\"","\"-.6125\"","\"-1.3069\"","\"-.1386\"","\"-.0270\"","\"-.4361\"","\"-.0327\"","\"6.5777\"","\"growth_cap_applies\"","\"governance_cap_applies\"","\"funding_cap_applies\"","\"boundary_uncertain\"","\"r_hurdle\"","\"no_extra_haircut\"","\"retrieval_gaps\"","\"Source-safe authored facts and bibliographic locators only. PublicURLs/hashes identify provenance, not bundledPDFs. V/C/M/A kept separate. No laterfinancialresults used.\"","\"url\"","\"document_date\"","\"locator\"","\"type\"","\"retrieved\"","\"sha256\"","\"limitation\"","\"Repono FY2025–26 annual report\"","\"https://repono.in/annual-reports/fy2025-26/Annual_Report/Repono_Annual_Report_2026_Final.pdf\"","\"2026-08\"","\"Printed49–61main/CARO/IFC;70–88standalone;91–106consolidatedaudit;107–134consolidatedaccounts;AOC1\"","\"V\"","\"2026-10-23; only facts public by2026-10-20 used\"","\"d78d54171875c2d793cdeef7ebd6497f0a3311ab818fca8bca5c602c2d661f6c\"","\"NegativeNCI, exportcreditnote, CFOclassifications and IPOproceeds need reconciliations.\"","\"SEBI-hosted final Repono prospectus\"","\"https://www.sebi.gov.in/sebi_data/attachdocs/aug-2025/1754566211166_910.pdf\"","\"2025-07\"","\"FinancialF1–F34; business134–148; objects; risks; relatedparties; capitalstructure\"","\"7a0f925ebb920758d23a0a312c6ca27856d51f118db5c0640fe8b8a9ff078b0c\"","\"FY23consolidated andFY24–25standalone; restated vintage distinct fromstatutorycurrentcomparatives.\"","\"AR20\"","\"Repono original FY2020 audited report\"","\"https://repono.in/annual-reports/2019-2020.pdf\"","\"2020\"","\"Complete main audit and applicable annexures; statement/notes pages cited in historical_inputs\"","\"ff0274ea33256a67a0607